cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use TransitTruth in academic work, cite it as below."
title: "TransitTruth: stateless verification of claimed model identity behind OpenAI-compatible relays"
abstract: "A bounded probe battery plus a single JSON report that tells whether an endpoint serves the model it claims, with three fail-closed verdicts (pass / suspicious / insufficient_evidence) and explicit non-claims."
type: software
